Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab
Overview
Operation Lifeline: Supply Chain Crisis Lab is a single-page React application that simulates real-world supply chain crisis management. Players take the role of a business executive responsible for making strategic decisions during major disruptions while balancing cost, customer satisfaction, inventory, and profitability.
Features
Welcome screen
Random fictional company generator
Random crisis generator
War Room strategy simulation
Animated KPI progress bars
Four-round supplier negotiation
CEO leadership assessment
AI investment planning
Executive performance dashboard
Personalized feedback and recommendations
Fully responsive dark-themed interface
Replay with randomized scenarios
Technologies Used
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript (ES6)
React (CDN)
Babel JSX
